# CR 702.16e: Gor Muldrak, Amphinologist's own `Protection:Salamander`
# (Affected$ You, a plain colon-structured characteristic -- protectionEach
# resolves it against Player.KeywordLines exactly the way it already does
# against a card's, staticability.go) refuses only a Salamander source.
# Lightning Bolt (an Instant, no creature type at all) does not match --
# ai's Bolt at human, Gor Muldrak's own controller, still connects. The
# matching half (a Salamander source actually refused) has no real corpus
# card to cast that combines the type with a targeted ability, so it is
# covered directly in cantbetargeted_internal_test.go instead.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 R
queue targets human
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
